Team Roles and Responsibilities

Requirements / Product Lead – Leonardo Gil Samanez
- Define project requirements and business rules.
- Ensure the system meets project objectives.
- Coordinate team priorities and deliverables.

UI / Accessibility Lead – Hadi
- Design and maintain the HTML and CSS.
- Ensure the interface is responsive and user-friendly.
- Improve accessibility and consistency across the website.

JavaScript / Logic Lead – Andres
- Develop JavaScript functions and system logic.
- Implement form validation and business rules.
- Troubleshoot and fix functionality issues.

Git / Integration Lead – Elizabeth
- Manage the GitHub repository and branches.
- Coordinate code merges and resolve conflicts.
- Ensure all team contributions work together.

QA / Documentation Lead – Leandro
- Test system functionality and identify errors.
- Document test cases and results.
- Maintain project documentation and verify requirements are met.
